WEBVTT

00:49.674 --> 00:52.552
Focus on what you're doing, Yuzuha!

01:11.071 --> 01:12.113
It's okay, Dad.

01:21.206 --> 01:22.499
I'm gonna survive.

02:52.505 --> 02:55.925
SHIBUYA STATION

03:17.780 --> 03:18.698
What?

03:54.984 --> 03:56.027
How did it go?

03:56.110 --> 03:57.737
Not good. Ugh, I got nothing.

03:58.738 --> 03:59.614
All right.

04:00.114 --> 04:02.742
Let's just grab anything
that might be useful.

04:14.587 --> 04:16.881
FURNITURE AND INTERIOR GOODS FLOOR

04:16.965 --> 04:18.508
Just as I thought,

04:18.591 --> 04:20.802
all the IC chips have been destroyed.

04:23.429 --> 04:25.306
Video cameras, digital clocks.

04:25.890 --> 04:28.268
Anything that operates
with an electronic circuit board

04:28.351 --> 04:29.602
isn't gonna work.

04:32.063 --> 04:34.274
But old stuff like this still works,

04:34.857 --> 04:37.277
since none of it has any IC chips.

04:40.113 --> 04:41.281
What does that mean?

04:43.032 --> 04:44.867
It might mean…

04:45.827 --> 04:46.869
Hurry!

04:46.953 --> 04:48.746
Look, fireworks!

04:53.459 --> 04:55.753
An electromagnetic pulse attack.

04:57.463 --> 04:59.507
I read about this online.

04:59.590 --> 05:01.551
When inserted into the stratosphere,

05:01.634 --> 05:05.680
it's a weapon capable of destroying
the electronics in an entire city.

05:06.973 --> 05:08.057
Seriously?

05:13.646 --> 05:16.399
So… why is this working?

05:18.651 --> 05:20.028
No idea.

05:22.447 --> 05:23.448
VISA
RYOHEI ARISU

05:23.531 --> 05:24.449
REMAINING DAYS: 3

05:25.199 --> 05:26.284
Hey!

05:38.671 --> 05:41.174
It's completely useless
if we can't charge it.

05:46.596 --> 05:48.806
This place looks safe enough.

05:57.648 --> 05:59.734
All right. This might be a good weapon.

06:00.902 --> 06:03.237
What do you need a weapon for?

06:05.448 --> 06:06.532
Zombies.

06:11.913 --> 06:13.873
You know you can't use
electricity or gas, right?

06:14.499 --> 06:16.292
But I can still use the portable stove.

06:16.376 --> 06:18.669
It has batteries
that I can also use in my flashlight.

06:18.753 --> 06:20.505
And I like a hot meal sometimes.

06:21.964 --> 06:22.924
Hmm.

06:45.238 --> 06:46.614
This is so good!

06:47.782 --> 06:49.575
Ah, nice and hot!

06:49.659 --> 06:51.702
We haven't eaten anything
since yesterday.

06:54.622 --> 06:57.125
Hey, what were you guys doing

06:57.208 --> 06:58.751
when everyone disappeared?

07:00.962 --> 07:02.004
Bathroom.

07:02.630 --> 07:04.465
We were all in the same stall.

07:05.091 --> 07:06.884
Why were you all in the same stall?

07:07.468 --> 07:08.386
Where were you?

07:13.558 --> 07:14.767
Saori…

07:24.068 --> 07:25.153
I was at work.

07:26.529 --> 07:29.323
I was in the conference room
doing some paperwork.

07:30.074 --> 07:31.159
And then,

07:31.784 --> 07:33.744
everyone in the office disappeared.

07:34.704 --> 07:37.457
Did you happen to see or hear
anything at all?

07:56.851 --> 07:57.810
Boss?

08:14.911 --> 08:16.037
Not really.

08:17.788 --> 08:19.582
I came to this place three days ago,

08:20.791 --> 08:24.212
and I was forced to play this game,
just like all of you were.

08:26.047 --> 08:28.424
Everybody died, except for me.

08:31.135 --> 08:32.845
You mean, you used them as bait, right?

08:32.929 --> 08:34.514
Think whatever you want.

08:36.015 --> 08:37.350
All I wanted…

08:38.935 --> 08:40.436
was to survive.

08:51.572 --> 08:52.740
Well…

09:00.414 --> 09:01.874
What kind of game was it?

09:05.294 --> 09:06.796
It was at the subway.

09:08.923 --> 09:10.883
They used poisonous gas in the game.

09:13.761 --> 09:15.137
Everyone was vomiting blood.

09:16.806 --> 09:18.516
Blood was coming out of their eyes.

09:23.312 --> 09:24.355
Weird, huh?

09:26.190 --> 09:28.150
The day everyone disappeared.

09:28.234 --> 09:29.902
It was yesterday for the three of us.

09:29.986 --> 09:30.987
Yeah.

09:31.070 --> 09:33.030
But it was three days ago for her.

09:33.114 --> 09:34.365
Why the time difference?

09:35.032 --> 09:35.866
That's right.

09:36.367 --> 09:38.244
And those vegetables that were rotten…

09:38.953 --> 09:41.080
They take longer than a few days
to go bad.

09:41.872 --> 09:43.207
What's going on?

09:45.334 --> 09:47.086
Maybe the speed of time is…

09:47.628 --> 09:49.088
different from the normal world?

09:49.797 --> 09:50.631
Huh?

09:51.424 --> 09:53.175
I don't really know, but…

09:53.884 --> 09:56.596
Take the, the four of us here.

09:57.305 --> 10:01.309
The timeline of when people disappeared
is different, like you said.

10:04.145 --> 10:07.940
Did we time travel while we were
in the subway bathroom stall?

10:08.024 --> 10:09.525
There's no way.

10:09.609 --> 10:11.485
There's also no way
people just disappeared.

10:11.569 --> 10:12.778
Time travel isn't real.

10:12.862 --> 10:14.614
Then explain the game
and people disappearing.

10:14.697 --> 10:16.115
I don't know, all right?

10:16.198 --> 10:17.491
Anyways,

10:17.575 --> 10:20.119
one thing we know for sure
about this game…

10:21.871 --> 10:23.664
A game master's running it.

10:24.332 --> 10:25.458
Game master?

10:26.250 --> 10:27.918
Someone came up with this game.

10:28.586 --> 10:29.837
That's for sure.

10:31.631 --> 10:33.799
So while we're in a bathroom stall,

10:33.883 --> 10:36.218
they get rid of everyone in Tokyo

10:36.302 --> 10:37.762
and set up this game?

10:37.845 --> 10:39.305
They keep track of our movements…

10:41.140 --> 10:43.893
…and fire lasers through our heads
when we make the wrong move.

10:45.394 --> 10:47.688
What kind of person would do that?

10:48.814 --> 10:50.483
I don't know, but it's definitely possible

10:50.566 --> 10:52.860
if they inserted
a highly accurate GPS microchip

10:52.943 --> 10:54.028
into our bodies.

10:54.111 --> 10:56.656
Spoken like a real IT geek.

10:57.198 --> 10:59.867
But who the hell could be
behind this thing?

10:59.950 --> 11:01.160
Hmm.

11:01.243 --> 11:02.453
Could it be…

11:02.953 --> 11:06.040
some government-run experiment
or something?

11:08.125 --> 11:10.878
There were some rumors
going around at my work.

11:11.879 --> 11:14.632
An IT company from Europe wanted
to conduct an experiment.

11:14.715 --> 11:16.509
They'd established a VR space,

11:16.592 --> 11:19.720
then created an alternate world
identical to the real one.

11:22.932 --> 11:25.768
But we should be able to tell VR
from the real world.

11:26.977 --> 11:28.479
Man…

11:28.562 --> 11:29.939
This hurts.

11:31.482 --> 11:33.442
I don't think
VR can cause burns like that.

11:35.903 --> 11:38.114
Maybe it's God.

11:38.197 --> 11:40.533
This has to be the work of God.

11:40.616 --> 11:42.743
Otherwise, how else do you explain it?

11:42.827 --> 11:44.829
You're talking crazy now.

11:45.496 --> 11:46.997
No, man. I think…

11:47.873 --> 11:49.333
God really does exist.

11:53.879 --> 11:56.215
Hey, is it getting worse?

11:58.634 --> 11:59.885
It's all right.

11:59.969 --> 12:01.011
Oh, it's gonna be fine.

12:08.686 --> 12:10.938
I think we gotta get Chota
to a doctor.

12:13.232 --> 12:14.692
You know how he is.

12:15.317 --> 12:17.194
It's probably hurting more than he says.

12:17.695 --> 12:18.696
But it's getting to him.

12:22.450 --> 12:23.409
Arisu.

12:24.910 --> 12:27.538
Let's get in the game tomorrow night,

12:27.621 --> 12:28.706
just you and me.

12:29.707 --> 12:30.624
What?

12:31.625 --> 12:33.836
But we've got three days left
on our visas.

12:35.880 --> 12:38.841
It's better to get in the game
while we still have time.

12:40.259 --> 12:41.802
I just don't think

12:41.886 --> 12:45.598
Chota's gonna be able to make it through.
He's in too much pain.

12:52.813 --> 12:54.023
How are you doing?

12:55.024 --> 12:56.150
Not bad, thanks.

12:57.610 --> 13:00.571
If the two of us don't figure out
how to get through this game,

13:00.654 --> 13:02.281
we won't be able to protect Chota.

13:04.158 --> 13:05.159
You're right, but…

13:06.827 --> 13:08.204
Maybe we can find a doctor too.

13:08.704 --> 13:10.498
We'll meet more people if we're playing.

13:12.583 --> 13:14.460
Do we really have to play again?

13:15.085 --> 13:17.129
Maybe we'll get an idea
what this game's about.

13:22.885 --> 13:23.969
Yeah, I guess.

13:25.012 --> 13:26.138
If we play,

13:26.222 --> 13:28.015
we might find out their signature.

13:29.975 --> 13:31.101
Signature?

13:32.061 --> 13:34.104
Yeah. If someone actually created
this game,

13:35.773 --> 13:39.068
there's a kind of signature they use,
like formatting.

13:39.985 --> 13:41.111
If we can discover that,

13:41.654 --> 13:43.989
we might be able to figure out
a strategy for the game.

14:04.176 --> 14:09.431
TOEI SENDAGAYA APARTMENT

14:37.835 --> 14:40.296
1 PER PERSON

14:41.088 --> 14:43.549
FACE RECOGNITION IN PROGRESS
PLEASE WAIT FOR A MOMENT

14:43.632 --> 14:46.427
Please wait until the game commences.

14:46.510 --> 14:48.929
There are currently ten participants.

14:49.013 --> 14:51.682
One minute until registration closes.

14:53.017 --> 14:54.977
Um, excuse me.

14:55.060 --> 14:58.272
Wha-- Where did all the people
in Tokyo go?

15:03.652 --> 15:04.820
This thing here--

15:04.904 --> 15:07.573
There's a lot of people here.
Maybe one's a doctor.

15:13.746 --> 15:15.372
1 PER PERSON

15:44.068 --> 15:46.236
Registration has closed.

15:46.820 --> 15:52.076
There are a total of 13 participants.
The game will now commence.

15:52.868 --> 15:54.453
E-- Excuse me.

15:54.536 --> 15:57.164
What is this? I was brought here.

15:57.247 --> 15:59.875
And I… I don't know what's going on.

16:00.960 --> 16:02.878
- It's a game.
- Shut up.

16:03.545 --> 16:05.422
Newbies will slow us down.

16:06.465 --> 16:07.716
They might hate us,

16:08.634 --> 16:11.011
but I think it'd be a good idea
to do what Shibuki did.

16:13.597 --> 16:16.600
Difficulty, Five of Spades.

16:20.729 --> 16:22.064
Five of Spades?

16:22.690 --> 16:24.441
It's gonna be physical.

16:24.525 --> 16:26.151
Only the strong survive.

16:26.652 --> 16:28.237
I'm Nitobe. Nice to meet you.

16:29.488 --> 16:31.448
The suit means something?

16:31.532 --> 16:32.992
Exactly.

16:33.951 --> 16:37.162
The suit of the playing card usually means
what kind of game it's gonna be.

16:37.913 --> 16:40.791
Clubs is a team battle.
Diamonds is your wits.

16:40.874 --> 16:42.001
And as for Hearts…

16:43.544 --> 16:45.170
That's the worst one.

16:45.838 --> 16:47.089
- Why is that?
- Huh?

16:48.048 --> 16:50.801
Because you're playing
with people's hearts then tear them apart.

16:53.846 --> 16:55.139
And the number?

16:55.723 --> 16:56.682
Difficulty.

16:57.850 --> 17:00.561
The higher the number on the card,

17:00.644 --> 17:01.895
the harder it is.

17:04.106 --> 17:06.525
Game is "Tag".

17:07.568 --> 17:11.196
Rule. Avoid whoever is "it".

17:11.280 --> 17:12.698
What?

17:17.453 --> 17:20.205
- So who's "it"?
- How should I know?

17:20.289 --> 17:22.207
Clear condition.

17:22.291 --> 17:24.334
Discover and touch the symbol

17:24.418 --> 17:27.963
hidden in one of the building's rooms
within the time limit.

17:28.047 --> 17:31.050
You clear the game
when this objective is fulfilled.

17:31.133 --> 17:32.801
Time limit, 20 minutes.

17:34.303 --> 17:35.429
After 20 minutes,

17:35.512 --> 17:39.183
the time bomb hidden
in the building will explode.

17:55.532 --> 17:57.534
TOEI SENDAGAYA APARTMENT

18:06.460 --> 18:07.711
O Holy Mother.

18:08.504 --> 18:11.465
Please forgive us
for all of our mortal sins.

18:12.841 --> 18:14.843
Our smiles are the light of hope.

18:15.886 --> 18:18.305
The Holy Mother will appear when we smile.

18:19.890 --> 18:24.311
O Holy Mother.
Please forgive us for all our mortal sins.

18:25.521 --> 18:27.773
Our smiles are the light of hope.

18:28.315 --> 18:30.776
The Holy Mother will appear when we smile.

18:31.652 --> 18:33.237
So you believe in God.

18:38.325 --> 18:39.159
Here.

18:41.078 --> 18:44.081
I've also been doing nothing
but praying recently.

18:45.666 --> 18:47.000
I don't believe in God.

18:48.085 --> 18:51.255
But my mother was obsessed
with some cult for a while.

18:51.338 --> 18:52.381
Hmm.

18:54.299 --> 18:56.301
Because of that, I was bullied in school.

18:56.802 --> 18:58.887
But Arisu and Karube saved me.

19:01.098 --> 19:02.724
They are good friends, aren't they?

19:05.060 --> 19:08.063
Karube is good at fighting
and the girls really love him,

19:08.897 --> 19:12.693
and Arisu is so smart
and comes from a respected family.

19:13.694 --> 19:14.862
Then there's me.

19:14.945 --> 19:18.031
My family's poor,
and I'm not really good at anything.

19:18.991 --> 19:23.287
Even now, when I'm hurt and useless,
they're still helping me.

19:25.539 --> 19:26.707
Some people…

19:27.583 --> 19:30.043
like being the strongest ones
in their group.

19:31.086 --> 19:32.546
It makes them feel better.

19:34.089 --> 19:35.465
They're just so different.

19:35.549 --> 19:38.260
Think you might feel good enough
to play the next game?

19:41.722 --> 19:43.015
How does your leg feel?

19:46.351 --> 19:47.853
They're just so different.

19:47.936 --> 19:51.356
Are you willing to die too,
to save your friends?

20:00.365 --> 20:03.535
The game will commence in two minutes.

20:04.661 --> 20:05.829
Stop following us.

20:05.913 --> 20:08.290
Just feeling you guys out.

20:08.373 --> 20:10.626
I'm thinking you two might be
good enough to be my allies.

20:10.709 --> 20:11.960
Lucky ass.

20:12.044 --> 20:14.421
- Are you a doctor?
- Nope, real estate agent.

20:15.214 --> 20:17.049
How many times have you played the game?

20:17.132 --> 20:19.593
Uh… Let's see, maybe five times?

20:20.177 --> 20:21.553
And you've always won?

20:21.637 --> 20:23.388
I guess so, yeah.

20:24.473 --> 20:26.266
Where should I go to hide?

20:26.350 --> 20:27.726
Look, I don't know, all right?

20:28.227 --> 20:29.978
You can only rely on yourself.

20:46.745 --> 20:48.664
If I wanna see where everyone is,

20:49.248 --> 20:50.999
this is the perfect location.

21:05.597 --> 21:06.848
Yeah.

21:06.932 --> 21:08.976
I got a weird feeling about this.

21:16.817 --> 21:17.901
Hmm…

21:19.027 --> 21:21.947
Looks like everyone's about to bite it,
just like they always do.

21:23.907 --> 21:27.286
I think, maybe
you've always been screwed over, Shibuki.

21:27.369 --> 21:29.496
You've never met anyone decent.

21:31.581 --> 21:32.833
You're right.

21:38.380 --> 21:40.173
Isn't it the same way for you?

21:44.678 --> 21:46.847
O Holy Mother…

21:46.930 --> 21:51.101
Please forgive us for all our mortal sins.

21:58.066 --> 21:59.276
No, you're wrong.

22:12.831 --> 22:14.249
It must have been rough.

22:39.066 --> 22:41.651
The game will now commence.

22:42.486 --> 22:45.739
The time limit is 20 minutes.

22:45.822 --> 22:47.949
Commence now.

22:52.496 --> 22:54.915
The tagger is on the move.

24:47.152 --> 24:49.488
All right,
let's find a room we can get into.

24:58.872 --> 25:01.458
We gotta get our asses moving!

25:20.852 --> 25:23.104
Three minutes have passed.

25:39.162 --> 25:40.539
What the hell was that?

26:08.441 --> 26:09.359
He's dead.

26:36.803 --> 26:39.055
Arisu!

26:40.056 --> 26:41.641
- Run!
- Go, go!

26:43.059 --> 26:43.893
Arisu!

26:43.977 --> 26:44.811
- Run!
- Outta the way!

26:44.894 --> 26:45.937
- Go down!
- Hurry!

26:46.021 --> 26:47.022
Go, go, go!

26:48.607 --> 26:49.691
Don't look back! Go!

26:50.483 --> 26:51.943
Move, move!

26:52.027 --> 26:54.195
What are you doing? Hey!

26:54.904 --> 26:56.323
Karube, wait!

26:57.032 --> 26:58.408
What are you doing?

26:59.159 --> 27:00.243
Get in there.

27:18.428 --> 27:20.180
You're a good person, Chota…

27:20.847 --> 27:22.265
I can trust you, can't I?

27:37.322 --> 27:38.406
When this started,

27:39.949 --> 27:41.910
I was having sex with my boss.

27:45.205 --> 27:46.539
And I hated it.

27:48.792 --> 27:50.835
I thought you said you were working.

27:52.253 --> 27:53.922
I don't trust those guys.

27:54.673 --> 27:56.800
They didn't need to know the truth,
did they?

28:19.030 --> 28:20.657
Since we're both the same,

28:21.533 --> 28:22.867
we should work together.

28:47.142 --> 28:48.601
So we can survive…

29:01.906 --> 29:03.032
Oh, my god!

29:03.116 --> 29:05.410
I can't do this. I can't do this!

29:51.748 --> 29:53.875
Hurry up, Mai!

29:57.754 --> 29:59.380
- Aya!
- Get up!

30:01.800 --> 30:02.926
Aya!

30:07.263 --> 30:09.224
I swear to God I'll kill you!

30:09.307 --> 30:11.518
Get away from me!

30:21.903 --> 30:24.364
I told you the truth
because I trust you, Chota.

30:36.334 --> 30:38.628
O Holy Mother…

30:40.380 --> 30:41.756
Holy Mother…

30:43.299 --> 30:45.468
O Holy Mother…

30:45.552 --> 30:48.137
The Holy Mother will appear when we smile.

30:49.514 --> 30:50.932
O Holy Mother…

30:52.225 --> 30:54.185
- Please forgive us for…
- Wait for me, okay?

30:54.269 --> 30:55.979
…our mortal sins.

30:57.063 --> 30:59.691
Our smiles are the light of hope.

31:00.525 --> 31:02.944
The Holy Mother will appear when we smile.

31:04.112 --> 31:05.738
O Holy Mother…

31:06.698 --> 31:10.285
Please forgive us for our mortal sins.

31:10.368 --> 31:12.036
Please accept this.

31:12.120 --> 31:14.581
Our smiles are the light of hope.

31:15.498 --> 31:18.001
The Holy Mother will appear when we smile.

31:19.127 --> 31:20.962
Very well, this way.

31:21.546 --> 31:25.091
O Holy Mother, please forgive us…

31:26.551 --> 31:29.220
The Holy Mother will appear when we smile.

31:30.221 --> 31:32.599
Our smiles are the light of hope.

31:34.392 --> 31:39.188
O Holy Mother,
please forgive us for our mortal sins.

31:39.272 --> 31:41.649
- Come on, let's go.
- We'll all go together.

31:42.317 --> 31:43.526
O Holy Mother,

31:44.736 --> 31:46.404
please forgive us for…

31:46.487 --> 31:49.115
…all our mortal sins.

31:50.909 --> 31:52.744
…all our mortal sins.

31:55.830 --> 31:58.333
O Holy Mother.

32:01.628 --> 32:02.712
Please.

32:03.504 --> 32:04.923
Save them.

32:08.134 --> 32:09.802
What are we gonna do, man?

32:10.595 --> 32:12.722
If you've got a solution, now's the time.

32:12.805 --> 32:13.640
I don't know what to do

32:13.723 --> 32:15.600
against something like that.

32:15.683 --> 32:18.519
- Come on, man. Think.
- Why don't you think of something?

32:38.414 --> 32:39.999
He didn't see us.

32:41.250 --> 32:43.294
His vision is narrowed
because of the mask.

32:44.462 --> 32:45.672
That's his weak point.

32:46.297 --> 32:48.007
This might be a way
to get through the game.

32:53.096 --> 32:54.973
- Everyone! He's up here!
- Hey!

32:55.056 --> 32:57.016
Over here, he's on the second level!

32:57.100 --> 32:58.977
- You'll get us killed!
- He can't see properly

32:59.060 --> 33:00.269
because of his mask!

33:00.353 --> 33:02.355
Tell us where he is if you see him,

33:02.438 --> 33:04.232
and let's all look for the symbol!

33:07.276 --> 33:08.778
That's a good idea, but…

33:09.737 --> 33:11.447
nobody wants to help.

33:16.119 --> 33:18.997
He's in the fourth-level hallway
in the central building!

33:19.080 --> 33:20.790
Anyone there should get out!

33:22.542 --> 33:23.418
Really?

33:25.837 --> 33:27.839
- Hurry, get out of here!
- What?

33:28.423 --> 33:29.716
I'm sorry.

33:33.428 --> 33:34.303
Oh, ho.

33:35.805 --> 33:37.056
A climber?

33:37.682 --> 33:38.808
She's not bad.

33:39.767 --> 33:40.768
TOEI SENDAGAYA APARTMENT

33:41.978 --> 33:44.480
The game is over in eight minutes.

33:45.690 --> 33:48.943
There are currently seven survivors.

34:32.695 --> 34:34.530
Hey! Yo!

34:35.114 --> 34:37.325
Over here! Hey!

34:44.707 --> 34:46.417
Leave him! We gotta get outta here!

34:47.251 --> 34:48.795
Come on, man. You can't stay here.

34:48.878 --> 34:50.046
Move!

34:52.799 --> 34:53.883
Hurry up!

35:05.561 --> 35:06.813
And here we go.

35:12.902 --> 35:13.903
Arisu!

35:14.737 --> 35:16.197
Hurry!

35:17.115 --> 35:18.282
Hurry.

35:19.033 --> 35:20.618
This guy's going down now.

35:20.701 --> 35:23.121
What? But he's got a machine gun.

35:23.204 --> 35:25.289
So? The tagger's human.

35:28.918 --> 35:31.921
He's 190 centimeters tall
and weighs 90 kilos,

35:32.004 --> 35:33.256
and he's right-handed.

35:33.339 --> 35:35.424
He's a pretty good shot, too.

35:35.508 --> 35:38.261
Probably military or law enforcement.

35:38.344 --> 35:39.595
Aguni!

35:40.388 --> 35:41.472
Here it is.

35:48.646 --> 35:49.856
Use this.

35:56.237 --> 35:57.488
Let's get this guy.

36:01.367 --> 36:02.994
You, go look for the symbol.

36:04.120 --> 36:04.954
What?

36:05.830 --> 36:08.291
Hey! Why should we do what you say?

36:08.374 --> 36:09.458
I got it.

36:09.542 --> 36:10.543
I'll go up to the top.

36:12.003 --> 36:12.920
Arisu!

36:13.421 --> 36:14.589
I don't like this.

36:14.672 --> 36:16.215
There's no other choice.

36:16.299 --> 36:17.967
I checked
the south side of the fifth floor,

36:18.050 --> 36:19.844
and the south and east side
of the sixth floor.

36:19.927 --> 36:22.263
Let's split up and find the symbol.

36:23.222 --> 36:24.974
I didn't check
the first and second floors.

36:25.057 --> 36:27.602
All right. I'll go check.

36:27.685 --> 36:29.187
- Hey!
- Hey!

36:35.776 --> 36:37.904
It's time to take this guy out.

36:43.034 --> 36:45.786
Five minutes remaining in the game.

36:47.747 --> 36:48.748
See you later.

36:49.832 --> 36:50.833
Yeah.

37:07.934 --> 37:09.894
Where the hell is that symbol?

37:15.107 --> 37:17.860
Calm down. Relax and think.

37:24.909 --> 37:26.744
Come on, follow me.

37:28.871 --> 37:30.915
He's using a MAC-10.

37:30.998 --> 37:33.960
He can go through a 32-round clip
in 1.5 seconds.

37:35.753 --> 37:37.797
We'll take him when he's reloading.

37:46.097 --> 37:47.223
I'm right here!

37:50.559 --> 37:52.728
That's right. Come on!

38:01.862 --> 38:02.905
Aguni?

38:05.491 --> 38:06.367
Aguni?

38:06.450 --> 38:08.160
Aguni!

38:12.832 --> 38:14.000
Son of a bitch.

39:40.461 --> 39:41.379
Come on.

39:42.046 --> 39:43.172
Think, dammit.

40:02.691 --> 40:05.778
Why would he shoot from so far away?

40:21.127 --> 40:22.420
Figured it out too, huh?

40:23.587 --> 40:25.798
Yeah, the symbol's in here.

40:34.557 --> 40:35.891
Gonna open it?

40:37.393 --> 40:39.019
Why was he chasing us?

40:40.187 --> 40:41.689
He could've just waited.

40:43.482 --> 40:45.317
Guess there's something we don't know.

40:47.987 --> 40:48.821
Except,

40:49.321 --> 40:50.364
not much time left.

40:56.495 --> 40:59.165
Three minutes remaining in the game.

41:49.006 --> 41:49.840
Look out!

42:01.393 --> 42:02.811
It never hurts to be prepared--

42:23.916 --> 42:25.209
PUSH BOTH BUTTONS
AT ONCE TO CLEAR GAME

42:25.292 --> 42:26.210
Damn it!

42:31.549 --> 42:33.092
Someone get over here!

42:33.175 --> 42:36.679
The symbol's up here! Room 406!

42:38.222 --> 42:39.807
I can't clear the game alone!

42:39.890 --> 42:42.059
We need two people to do it!

42:42.142 --> 42:44.186
Seriously?

42:44.770 --> 42:46.355
Arisu!

43:11.255 --> 43:13.173
Now we're having fun, aren't we?

43:23.726 --> 43:26.562
One minute remaining in the game.

43:44.246 --> 43:45.831
Someone!

43:45.914 --> 43:47.374
Help me!

44:01.639 --> 44:04.683
30 seconds remaining in the game.

44:17.738 --> 44:19.657
20 seconds.

44:31.251 --> 44:32.086
You called?

44:32.169 --> 44:33.337
Ten seconds.

44:34.505 --> 44:36.423
Here!

44:43.263 --> 44:44.348
Five.

44:44.431 --> 44:45.683
- Four.
- The buttons!

44:45.766 --> 44:46.975
Three.

44:47.059 --> 44:49.103
Two. One.

44:53.482 --> 44:55.234
EMERGENCY BUTTON
STOP

45:02.658 --> 45:06.203
Game cleared. Congratulations.

45:34.690 --> 45:35.649
Oh, no.

46:17.441 --> 46:18.567
So this guy…

46:19.735 --> 46:21.820
had no choice but to play the game?

46:30.746 --> 46:32.748
Are you there? Over.

46:34.374 --> 46:35.959
Do you copy?

46:36.752 --> 46:38.420
Repeat. Are you there?

46:42.591 --> 46:44.802
Please respond. Over.

46:49.348 --> 46:52.684
Do you copy?
Answer. Over. Do you read?

46:52.768 --> 46:54.186
…it's in our hands now.

46:55.813 --> 46:56.980
"Answer"?

46:59.191 --> 47:00.567
Hey, can you hear me?

47:02.110 --> 47:04.238
Hey, what "answer"?

47:06.448 --> 47:07.699
Come back.

47:07.783 --> 47:10.577
The answer is in our hands now.

47:11.745 --> 47:13.789
Get back to the Beach.

47:15.123 --> 47:16.291
"The Beach"?

47:30.013 --> 47:31.098
Get back.

47:31.974 --> 47:33.976
Get back to the Beach.

47:35.310 --> 47:37.896
Get back to the Beach!
